msgid "<p>The Editoria11y <strong><em>@type</em></strong> view is missing.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>The Editoria11y <strong><em>@type</em></strong> view is missing.</"
"p><p>Visningen <strong><em>@type</em></strong> för Editoria11y saknas.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>There are three view configurations this module installs, found in its /"
"config/install folder. Each must be installed for this dashboard to display "
"results.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>There are three view configurations this module installs, found in its /"
"config/install folder. Each must be installed for this dashboard to display "
"results.</p><p>Modulen installerar tre visningskonfigurationer i katalogen /"
"config/install. Alla måste installeras för att dashboardet ska kunna visa "
"resultat.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>To fix: copy and paste the contents of <strong>/editoria11y/config/"
"install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> into a \"View\" type import at "
"<a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import\">/admin/"
"config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. If you sync your "
"configuration to the filesystem, be sure to include these Views in your "
"repository.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>To fix: copy and paste the contents of <strong>/editoria11y/config/"
"install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> into a \"View\" type import at "
"<a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import\">/admin/"
"config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. If you sync your "
"configuration to the filesystem, be sure to include these Views in your "
"repository.</p><p>För att åtgärda: kopiera innehållet i <strong>/editoria11y/"
"config/install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> och klistra in det i en "
"import av typen ”View” på <a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/"
"single/import\">/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. "
"Om du synkroniserar konfigurationen till filsystemet, se till att dessa "
"visningar finns med i ditt repository.</p>"

